    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link UtcInstant#of(TaiInstant)} correctly converts TAI instants to UTC instants across a wide range of days and intra-day seconds. <p>For days in the pre-leap-second era the TAI–UTC difference is exactly {@value #INITIAL_TAI_UTC_OFFSET_SECS} seconds, so a TAI instant at second {@code (dayIndex * SECS_PER_DAY + secondIndex + INITIAL_TAI_UTC_OFFSET_SECS)} should map to the UTC instant at MJD {@code MJD_TAI_EPOCH + dayIndex}, nano-of-day {@code secondIndex * NANOS_PER_SEC + extraNanos}."
